    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1091">

                <pb facs="0920" n="804" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg804"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/302.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Florida to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tallahassee, Fla.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Citizens of Florida now in Mexico City have to-day wired me requesting that I
                    ascertain immediately whether United States will intervene Mexico and give them
                    warning. Such information as you can consistently furnish me will be appreciated
                    for this purpose.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert W. Gilchrist.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
